### Summary
This PR implements a fix for gating segment load requests in the delegator based
on schema versions, to prevent loading segments before the delegator schema view
is ready. It moves the schema version gating into the delegator and adjusts load
behavior to retry rather than fail hard on schema version mismatches. The change
is large and cross-cutting across the querynodev2 and querycoordv2 layers, and 
includes extensive new unit and integration test coverage, especially for task 
execution and schema gating paths.

